<TXSPN>―Someone... help me...<PG>
―Help me...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm? Who's there?"</STYLE><PG>
―Anyone. I want to be saved.<PG>
―I can't... take any more...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uh... you say help, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―That voice... 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE> can save me! Hurry, come this way!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh? This way? Which way is that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Hurry... 
{PAUSE ""}
Help me...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n0\r\n255\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
